@startuml Hinh_2_5_Sequence_Chuyen_Khoan_Fiat_Crypto
title Hình 2.5 – Sequence: Chuyển khoản (Fiat và Crypto)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Người dùng" as User
participant "Web/Mobile" as UI
participant "TransactionController\nCryptoTransactionController" as Ctrl
participant "TransactionService" as FiatSvc
participant "LedgerService" as Ledger
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "RPC Node\n(Web3j)" as RPC
queue "Kafka" as Kafka

== Fiat – Chuyển tiền nội bộ ==
User -> UI : Nhập số TK đích, số tiền, mô tả
UI -> Ctrl : POST /api/v1/transactions/transfer\n(idempotencyKey, JWT)
Ctrl -> FiatSvc : transfer(request, userId)
FiatSvc -> FiatSvc : validateUserForTransaction\n(KYC >10M, LOCKED)
FiatSvc -> DB : Kiểm tra idempotencyKey
FiatSvc -> DB : BEGIN @Transactional
FiatSvc -> Ledger : DEBIT source + CREDIT destination
FiatSvc -> DB : Lưu Transaction (TRANSFER)
FiatSvc -> DB : COMMIT
FiatSvc -> Kafka : publish(TransactionEvent)
FiatSvc --> Ctrl : TransactionResponse
Ctrl --> UI : 200 OK
UI --> User : Chuyển tiền thành công

== Crypto – Gửi on-chain ==
User -> UI : Ký giao dịch (MetaMask / ví in-app)
UI -> Ctrl : POST /api/v1/crypto/transactions/broadcast\n(signedTxHex)
Ctrl -> RPC : eth_sendRawTransaction
RPC --> Ctrl : txHash
Ctrl -> DB : Lưu CryptoTransaction
Ctrl -> Kafka : publish(TransactionEvent CRYPTO_SEND)
Ctrl --> UI : transactionHash
UI --> User : Hiển thị hash + explorer link

@enduml
